# ==============================================================================
# Mosquitto Access Control List (ACL) - Principle of Least Privilege
# Identities mapped from Client Certificate Common Name (CN)
# ==============================================================================

# ESP32 Edge Device: can ONLY publish telemetry to the gateway ingest topic
user esp32-client
topic write care/gateway/data

# Python Backend Bridge: can ONLY subscribe to read incoming telemetry
user python-client
topic read care/gateway/#
